## IMPORTANT RULES
- List EVERY field from the requirements - no summaries
- Use correct field types:
  - text: Names, descriptions, free text
  - number: Quantities, ages, counts
  - boolean: YES/NO questions
  - date: Dates, timestamps
  - email: Email addresses
  - phone: Phone numbers
  - single-select: Pick ONE from options (list the options!)
  - multi-select: Pick MULTIPLE from options
  - relation: Link to another table
- For select fields, list ALL options in the Notes column
- NEVER use "emery-*" tools - only use database_crud, table_crud, field_crud
